# The licence tool. Its own Gradle build, on standby, and not part of what Kubo ships. It holds the private
# half of a signing key pair, so it stays out of this repository until there is a decision about where it
# belongs: a repository this one mirrors releases from is the last place a signing key should drift into.
kubo_licence/
